  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting implementation and dissemination of the regional pathway on sustainable public procurement for sustainable food systems.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In consultation with UNEP and key stakeholders of the Sustainable Public Procurement and Sustainable Food Systems Programmes of the One Planet Network, FAO will support the implementation of prioritized recommendations on sustainable public procurement for sustainable food systems (framework for action) in one selected country (To be Identified) and build capacity by disseminating findings at regional and global level.</narrative>
  </description>
